    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight. Survive. Escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a lone knight trapped deep within a forgotten dungeon, overrun by vicious orc hordes. <i>Tombs &amp; Trials\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced 2D top-down dungeon crawler where survival is earned one wave at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through relentless waves of orcs\u2014each type deadlier than the last\u2014as you push deeper into the twisting labyrinth in search of freedom. Slash, dodge, and strategize as you uncover secrets, gather loot, and unlock your path to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense wave-based combat with a variety of orc enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down action with modern controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful weapons and upgrades to aid your escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark dungeon atmosphere and retro-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal: escape the dungeon\u2026 or die trying</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the onslaught and reclaim the light?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight. Survive. Escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a lone knight trapped deep within a forgotten dungeon, overrun by vicious orc hordes. <i>Tombs &amp; Trials\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced 2D top-down dungeon crawler where survival is earned one wave at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through relentless waves of orcs\u2014each type deadlier than the last\u2014as you push deeper into the twisting labyrinth in search of freedom. Slash, dodge, and strategize as you uncover secrets, gather loot, and unlock your path to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense wave-based combat with a variety of orc enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down action with modern controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful weapons and upgrades to aid your escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark dungeon atmosphere and retro-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal: escape the dungeon\u2026 or die trying</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the onslaught and reclaim the light?</p>",
